note The file's content hash, the key everything derived from this file is cached under. Computed on the tab-expanded text (Contents::new expands tabs), so what is hashed is what is displayed. The algorithm is FNV-1a (the domain's TextHash::of), and the map keys its anchored slices with the same function.

