note Turns the callee's source text into a Call. Generics, argument lists and index brackets are stripped and a macro's '!' dropped, then the last dotted or scoped segment is the name and the one before it the qualifier. A name longer than 64 characters or not starting with a letter or underscore is no call. This is the whole of what the tree-sitter backend knows about a call.

